@startuml

title DSA P15: Dispute and Breach Handling
!include ./style.iuml

start
:Suspected breach reported\n(use beyond purpose, missed duty, leak);
:Contain: suspend grants, clients and keys\n(P13, process H in smart-trust-phw);
:Gather evidence: audit records (P12),\nthe log's hash chain,\nthe hash of the signed agreement version (P2);
:Follow the dispute clause\nin the legal text;
:Notify those the law requires;
if (Outcome?) then (reinstate)
  :Lift the suspension;
elseif () then (amend)
  :New agreement version (P14);
else (terminate)
  :Terminate (P14); revoke (P13);\nstart end-of-agreement duties;
endif
stop

@enduml
